msgid ""
"Spotify no longer accepts the shared sign-in Sirensong used before. Register "
"Sirensong to keep listening."
msgstr ""
"Spotify 已不再接受 Sirensong 以前使用的共享登录。请注册 Sirensong 以继续收"
"听。"

