msgid ""
"Sirensong no longer offers the shared sign-in, and Spotify can stop "
"accepting it at any time. Register Sirensong and you won't have to wait."
msgstr ""
"Sirensong 已不再提供共享登录，Spotify 也随时可能停止接受它。注册 Sirensong，"
