#: src/ui/settings.rs:1535
msgid "Searching rings what matches and leaves the rest in place. Off, the search is a filter, as Zoom in and Only selected treat the others."
msgstr "搜索会圈出匹配项，其余保持原位。关闭时，搜索是一个筛选条件，放大和仅所选会像对待其他筛选条件一样对待它。"

#. Translators: A settings section: how songs play, on this computer or through Spotify Soloist.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:739
msgid "Playback"
msgstr "播放"

#. Translators: A settings section: the equalizer, which shapes the sound.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1475
msgid "Sound"
msgstr "声音"

#. Translators: A settings section: the playlist map on Home and in the Library, and what Home suggests.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1477
msgid "Home and map"
msgstr "首页和地图"

#. Translators: A settings section: the player bar visualizer and MilkDrop.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1481
msgid "Visualizers"
msgstr "可视化"

#. Translators: A settings section: the window, the tray, starting with the computer, and updates.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1483
msgid "Window and system"
msgstr "窗口和系统"

#. Translators: A settings section: the proxy for network requests.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1485
msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

#. Translators: Under a greyed-out setting. {setting} is the name of the setting it depends on.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:182
msgid "Needs {setting}."
msgstr "需要“{setting}”。"

#. Translators: Under a greyed-out setting. {setting} is the name of the setting that turns it off.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:190
msgid "Off while {setting} is on."
msgstr "“{setting}”开启时关闭。"

#. Translators: Under a greyed-out setting. {setting} is a setting's name and {choice} one of its choices.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:202
msgid "Needs {setting} set to {choice}."
msgstr "需要将“{setting}”设为“{choice}”。"

#. Translators: A playlist chosen to add to another one turned out to hold no songs.
#: src/app.rs:13496
msgid "That playlist has no songs to add"
msgstr "该播放列表中没有可添加的歌曲"

#. Translators: A settings section named for the Funnel projects (one thing at a time, nothing suggested), of which Sirensong's "Only what I ask for" is a part. Funnel is a name: keep it as it is.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1548
msgid "Funnel"
msgstr "Funnel"

#. Translators: A small link under the Funnel settings: the Funnel browser extension. Funnel is a name.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2262
msgid "Funnel for Firefox"
msgstr "Funnel Firefox 版"

#. Translators: A small label under the Funnel settings: the Funnel Android app, which has no page to link to yet. Funnel is a name.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:2278
msgid "Funnel for Android"
msgstr "Funnel Android 版"

#. Translators: A setting: keep the results of every search on this computer.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:949
msgid "Keep a search log"
msgstr "保留搜索日志"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1603
msgid "Keeps what every search showed, on this computer only, for the last 1,000 searches. Nothing is uploaded."
msgstr "仅在这台电脑上保存每次搜索显示的结果，最多保留最近 1,000 次搜索。不会上传任何内容。"

#. Translators: The title of the list of searches Sirensong kept, and the button on Home that opens it.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:372
msgid "Search log"
msgstr "搜索日志"

#. Translators: Asked before the search log is emptied.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:383
msgid "Every search kept will be deleted. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "保存的所有搜索都将被删除。此操作无法撤销。"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:441
msgid "No searches kept yet."
msgstr "还没有保存的搜索。"

#. Translators: In the empty search log, while Keep a search log is off.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:448
msgid "Keep a search log is off, in Settings > Search."
msgstr "“保留搜索日志”已关闭，位于 设置 > 搜索。"

#. Translators: How many results a search in the search log found. {count} is a number.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:471
msgid "Results: {count}"
msgstr "结果：{count}"

#. Translators: The button that empties the search log.
#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:516
msgid "Clear search log"
msgstr "清除搜索日志"

#. Translators: A setting: a button on Home that opens the search log.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:951
msgid "Search log button on Home"
msgstr "首页上的搜索日志按钮"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1612
msgid "A button on Home, beside the map's choices or under the greeting, opens the searches kept."
msgstr "首页上地图选项旁或问候语下方的按钮会打开保存的搜索。"

#. Translators: A Settings category: the account, playback and the equalizer.
#: src/model.rs:1113
msgid "Listening"
msgstr "收听"

#. Translators: A Settings category: the Library, the Home map and Funnel.
#: src/model.rs:1115
msgid "Library & Home"
msgstr "音乐库和首页"

#. Translators: A Settings category: themes, the visualizers and the mini player's skins.
#: src/model.rs:1118
msgid "Look & feel"
msgstr "外观"

#. Translators: A Settings category: Vacuum, and what Sirensong keeps of what you did.
#: src/model.rs:1120
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "隐私"

#. Translators: A settings section under Privacy: the play history and the search log Sirensong keeps on this computer.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1780
msgid "Your history"
msgstr "你的历史记录"

#. Translators: {file} is the path of the search log file.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1789
msgid "The searches kept while Keep a search log is on, in {file}. This file is never uploaded."
msgstr "“保留搜索日志”开启时保存的搜索，位于 {file}。此文件从不上传。"
